    'Medium two-shot, both men from the head to the knees, in the middle third of the frame, on the gravel clearing.',
    "<mack_thug> wipes the back of his neck with a rag and speaks the first line to <rick_boss> in a low voice, his eyes on Rick, his eyes round and his brows lifted. <rick_boss> listens with his eyes on Mack, then speaks the second line to <mack_thug> with a sly greedy leer on his lips and his brows lifted.",
